    "lede": "Tertiary education should be an inclusive arena of scholarship, social belonging, and romantic fulfillment for all students. Navigating campus romance with physical, mobility, visual, auditory, or hidden health disabilities requires self-advocacy, choosing accessible date venues, and building partnerships rooted in mutual dignity.",
    "date": "2026-09-27",
